					<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
						<font size="11"/>
					</textElement>
					<text><![CDATA[TrueLove guarantees that our diamonds and gemstones are conflict free based on personal knowledge and/or written guarantees provided by our suppliers. We require our diamond suppliers to subscribe to the Kimberly Process warranty system. All jewelry is manufactured in the USA, India and China. When product is imported from India and China, all custom duties have been paid for by TrueLove Diamonds.]]></text>
